# Block Drop — observability overlay

Platform pattern: `app-observability`. Dashboard layout: [`docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md`](../../docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md).

- Project label: `project=block-drop`.
- Critical API synthetic: `/api/scores` (stg + prod).
- Scrape: `AWS/Lambda`, `AWS/CloudFront` (incl. OriginLatency).
- Dashboards: `Block Drop — Production` / `Block Drop — Staging` — JSON at `infra/terraform/grafana/dashboards/block-drop-prod.json` and `block-drop-stg.json` (regenerate with `python3 infra/terraform/grafana/scripts/generate-env-dashboards.py`).
- Stack service account name used for publish: `block-drop-terraform`.
- Probe script: `infra/terraform/grafana/scripts/probe-cloudflare-graphql.sh`.
